    "text": "By Kenny Graves ,\n14 hours ago COLLEGE STATION, Texas (KRHD) — Local restaurants struggle to survive amid rising costs and staffing challenges. The restaurant industry in College Station has faced significant hardships in recent years, with many locally owned establishments forced to close their doors permanently. The Anchor Bar is among several local spots that have gone out of business as economic pressures continue to mount. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
